et lost and sometimes stubborn as they learn how to walk.\nBut you'll be able to save all the slippers.\n\nA new concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(2)1440_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "843670026323221", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_843670029656554_4170918606599011011_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UT_kYhu562MQ7kNvwFllRmd&_nc_oc=Adn6DBMe9HooWGdk0_wbuqmqYU4wS53V1AiAO7fXytTsFtFASQhrs7tnuOLsf6-4-F4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvOwe0ck8Kkx5ujMjBSTsJMgK02aNCB-XfQpF4yJj9zOQ&oe=69A19E9F"}, {"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(\uc2dc\uc5482)2560_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "627571058261409", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_627571061594742_7128199620299863828_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X7K32UU4Ah4Q7kNvwE9Uq0y&_nc_oc=AdmYw_Tj7T0nUOPJovJxZOEwkUV61SUwR4dRjmVFw1PG_jrDcf86jm6zGsJlGcxtkzY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afti6TU_XKUBz3GQjCORkaVmISPSN1CLBcA-x7Lo4Bqg6g&oe=69A19A87"}, {"file_name": "app_logo.png", "id": "583935226146634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223477_583935232813300_935540870816570877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z2_JbXIPnlsQ7kNvwG2cT1s&_nc_oc=AdnCx2-LsC5Ebcpxi_4Jv3k0LLpVMFcFOXgo48goUGPoXsW8qT2MS70y_bfGEYvY_So&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvaJkm8i99viW6FSvLJUvesgglv-NSvxy2Ce1bRbBsKlg&oe=69A19ED7"}, {"file_name": "